<title>UK: Alumasc plummets on weak first-half results.</title>
<headline>Alumasc plummets on weak first-half results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Alumasc Group Plc fell sharply on Tuesday after the engineering and construction products group announced weak 1996 first-half results, traders said.</p>
<p>Alumasc shares plummeted 41-1/2p to 330p by 1045 GMT.</p>
</text>
